inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)\\)</span> (assignments, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9b641c11eab6e875\" href=\"?note=9b641c11eab6e875\" title=\"17-df-assignment\">17-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Sat}_L\\)</span> (satisfaction predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> (sentence-truth notation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\sigma\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)\\;\n\\operatorname{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\sigma\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)\\;\n\\operatorname{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Because <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> has no free variables, its satisfaction value is independent of\nthe chosen assignment.  Universal quantification over assignments makes that fact\nexplicit without treating provability as part of semantic truth.</p>\n<p>对应原书 1.3.17 及印刷 p.32 的真值约定。载体非空，故存在总赋值；句子无自由变量，<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"ee38febe67086306\" href=\"?note=ee38febe67086306\" title=\"17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence\">17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence</a> 保证“每个赋值”与原书“某个／每个足够长序列”等价。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"9b641c11eab6e875","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"ec1305482f8eec2e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$（语言，见 [[17-df-first-order-language]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A}$ ($\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$, see [[17-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma$ ($\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L$, see [[17-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"9b641c11eab6e875","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)$ (assignments, see [[17-df-assignment]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"ec1305482f8eec2e","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sat}_L$ (satisfaction predicate, see [[17-df-satisfaction]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence","status":"resolved","id":"ee38febe67086306","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"对应原书 1.3.17 及印刷 p.32 的真值约定。载体非空，故存在总赋值；句子无自由变量，[[17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence]] 保证“每个赋值”与原书“某个／每个足够长序列”等价。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sat}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\models","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\sigma\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)\\;\n\\operatorname{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s,\\sigma).","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false}],"bytes":2079,"backlinks":[{"id":"48d3ae3ee6d03d67","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal V=\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，语言、结构及一阶句子真值见 [[17-df-first-order-language]]、[[17-df-structure]]、[[17-df-sentence-truth]]；同构见 [[17-df-isomorphism]]。$\\mathscr L,\\mathscr L_1,\\mathscr L_2$ 是固定的语义接口：对每个 $L\\in\\mathcal V$，$S_{\\mathscr L}(L)$ 是句子编码的一个集合；$E_{\\mathscr L}(L,\\mathfrak M,\\sigma)$ 是在 $\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$、$\\sigma\\in S_{\\mathscr L}(L)$ 上给定的二值谓词。它们是固定的可定义类参数；下式是关于这些接口的元理论模式，不把全语言上的赋值误作一个集合，也不量化一个 ZFC 内部真谓词。$\\Gamma$ 为句子集合。$\\mathrm{FO}$ 是由下式完全指定的一阶语义接口。"},{"id":"ba56c3cb1dd7ec8d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ and sentence truth are from [[17-df-sentence]] and [[17-df-sentence-truth]]."},{"id":"45c3869fde7fe37f","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$ 及总字母表 $\\Sigma_L$ 见 [[17-df-first-order-language]]；$\\mathfrak A=(|\\mathfrak A|,\\mathcal I)\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 见 [[17-df-structure]]。对每个 $a\\in|\\mathfrak A|$，令 $c_a=\\operatorname{Name}_L(a)$，其中 $\\operatorname{Name}_L$ 是 [[17-df-language-constants]] 中已定义的规范新名字函数。$L(C)$ 取 [[17-df-language-constants]] 的常元扩张，$\\upharpoonright L$ 取 [[17-df-reduct]] 的语言约化。原子公式集 $\\mathrm{AtomForm}_{L(\\mathfrak A)}$、句子集 $\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\mathfrak A)}$ 与句子真值 $\\models$ 分别见 [[17-df-atomic-formula]]、[[17-df-sentence]]、[[17-df-sentence-truth]]。以下定义 $C_{\\mathfrak A}$、$L(\\mathfrak A)$、规范命名扩张 $\\mathfrak A_{\\mathfrak A}$ 和 $\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathfrak A)$。"},{"id":"b664bed1223db216","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\models$ (truth in a structure, see [[17-df-sentence-truth]])"},{"id":"bdfdb62527f9710d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\sigma$ (sentence truth, see [[1